  "basis": "Named PMTiles bridge footway 35184405327539 and Angel’s Bridge POI 17592517490936 establish the original Inglisild/Q12364556 identity; no exact-QID footprint claimed. Anchor [26.717632704376012,58.37959986270152], heading -0.9482293478071121, is refined to the independent Lossi crossing. +X southeast, -X northwest; +Z southwest/uphill toward Toome Hill, -Z northeast/downhill toward central Tartu. Unequal mapped endpoints [-14.615345420985541,0] / [16.794144088365687,0] retain the 31.40949m transport length. Width 4.6m and source datum 64.6m/floor 70.35m are explicit visual approximations. Nine actual mapped boundary width samples have support and retained paving at every LOD; maximum model/paving difference 0.00600433349609375m. Three lower-road probes retain at least 4.039500618940323m below the conservative beam datum; renderer-fit results, not surveyed legal clearance.",
